<p>Kontext makes editing images easy! Specify what you want to change and Kontext will follow. It is capable of
understanding the context of the image, making it easier to edit them without having to describe in details what
you want to do.</p></div></div><h3 id="api-call-install" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-lg"><span>1. Calling the API</span><a href="#api-call-install" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h3><div class="space-y-8"><h3 id="api-call-install" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-lg"><span>Install the client</span><a href="#api-call-install" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h3><div class="prose max-w-full dark:prose-invert"><p>The client provides a convenient way to interact with the model API.</p></div><div class="space-y-8"><div class="not-prose h-auto max-h-full w-full space-y-2"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center [&amp;_span.tab-indicator]:hidden rounded border border-stroke-base p-0.5 [&amp;&gt;button]:rounded-sm font-medium text-content-strong data-[state=active]:[&amp;&gt;button]:bg-surface-alpha-strong data-[state=active]:[&amp;&gt;button]:text-content-stronger data-[state=active]:[&amp;&gt;button]:border-stroke-base text-sm [&amp;&gt;button]:px-2 [&amp;&gt;button]:py-1.5" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-content-npm" data-state="active" id="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-trigger-npm" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap overflow-visible border border-transparent px-6 transition-all md:px-4 h-fit min-w-fit md:min-w-[6rem] font-medium text-content-light disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring group/tab relative" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">npm<span data-role="tab-indicator" class="tab-indicator absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] opacity-0 group-data-[state=active]/tab:opacity-100 duration-250 transition-opacity ease-in bg-primary"></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-content-yarn" data-state="inactive" id="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-trigger-yarn" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap overflow-visible border border-transparent px-6 transition-all md:px-4 h-fit min-w-fit md:min-w-[6rem] font-medium text-content-light disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring group/tab relative" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">yarn<span data-role="tab-indicator" class="tab-indicator absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] opacity-0 group-data-[state=active]/tab:opacity-100 duration-250 transition-opacity ease-in bg-primary"></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-content-pnpm" data-state="inactive" id="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-trigger-pnpm" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap overflow-visible border border-transparent px-6 transition-all md:px-4 h-fit min-w-fit md:min-w-[6rem] font-medium text-content-light disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring group/tab relative" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">pnpm<span data-role="tab-indicator" class="tab-indicator absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] opacity-0 group-data-[state=active]/tab:opacity-100 duration-250 transition-opacity ease-in bg-primary"></span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-content-bun" data-state="inactive" id="radix-:R2s99uuj7rmjkq:-trigger-bun" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap overflow-visible border border-transparent px-6 transition-all md:px-4 h-fit min-w-fit md:min-w-[6rem] font-medium text-content-light disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring group/tab relative" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item="">bun<span data-role="tab-indicator" class="tab-indicator absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] opacity-0 group-data-[state=active]/tab:opacity-100 duration-250 transition-opacity ease-in bg-primary"></span></button></div></div><div class="group relative rounded bg-surface-alpha w-full font-mono text-sm h-full max-h-full"><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 p-2 opacity-50 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded border font-heading font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-[1.5] border-transparent bg-transparent text-content-base hover:bg-surface-alpha-strong hover:text-content-strong data-[state=open]:bg-surface-alpha-strong h-9 w-9 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current opacity-70 hover:opacity-100" type="button" aria-label="Copy" name="copyCode"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-files"><path d="M20 7h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2"></path><path d="M9 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"></path><path d="M3 7.6v12.8A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4.6 22h9.8"></path></svg></button></div><pre text="npm install --save @fal-ai/client" style="background:transparent;color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%);text-shadow:0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;, &quot;Fira Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, monospace;direction:ltr;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1rem;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-hyphens:none;-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;hyphens:none;padding:1rem;margin:0 auto;overflow:scroll;border-radius:0.3em;overflow-wrap:break-word;max-height:100%"><code class="bg-transparent leading-normal whitespace-pre-wrap" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>npm install --save @fal-ai/client</span></span></code></pre></div></div><div role="alert" class="space-x-2 text-content-base [&amp;&gt;svg]:icon-lg [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current relative w-full flex flex-row items-start justify-start [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-info-dark dark:[&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-info [&amp;_.alert-title]:text-info-dark dark:[&amp;_.alert-title]:text-info rounded border border-stroke-light p-4 bg-black/[1%] dark:bg-black/5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info icon-md min-w-fit flex-none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div class="flex-1 overflow-hidden"><h5 class="alert-title mb-2 pt-1 font-heading text-lg font-medium leading-none tracking-tight">Migrate to @fal-ai/client</h5><div class="text-content-light [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed"><div class="prose max-w-full dark:prose-invert"><p>The <code>@fal-ai/serverless-client</code> package has been deprecated in favor of <code>@fal-ai/client</code>. Please check the <a href="https://docs.fal.ai/clients/javascript#migration-from-serverless-client-to-client">migration guide</a> for more information.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="space-y-8"><h3 id="api-call-setup" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-lg"><span>Setup your API Key</span><a href="#api-call-setup" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h3><div class="prose max-w-full dark:prose-invert"><p>Set <code>FAL_KEY</code> as an environment variable in your runtime.</p></div><div class="not-prose h-auto max-h-full w-full space-y-2"><div class="group relative rounded bg-surface-alpha w-full font-mono text-sm h-full max-h-full"><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 p-2 opacity-50 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded border font-heading font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-[1.5] border-transparent bg-transparent text-content-base hover:bg-surface-alpha-strong hover:text-content-strong data-[state=open]:bg-surface-alpha-strong h-9 w-9 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current opacity-70 hover:opacity-100" type="button" aria-label="Copy" name="copyCode"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-files"><path d="M20 7h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2"></path><path d="M9 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"></path><path d="M3 7.6v12.8A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4.6 22h9.8"></path></svg></button></div><pre text="export FAL_KEY=&quot;YOUR_API_KEY&quot;" style="background:transparent;color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%);text-shadow:0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;, &quot;Fira Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, monospace;direction:ltr;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1rem;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-hyphens:none;-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;hyphens:none;padding:1rem;margin:0 auto;overflow:scroll;border-radius:0.3em;overflow-wrap:break-word;max-height:100%"><code class="bg-transparent leading-normal whitespace-pre-wrap" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="background-color:transparent"><span class="token" style="color:hsl(29, 54%, 61%)">export</span><span> </span><span class="token assign-left" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">FAL_KEY</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">=</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;YOUR_API_KEY&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div><div class="space-y-8"><h3 id="api-call-submit-request" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-lg"><span>Submit a request</span><a href="#api-call-submit-request" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h3><div class="prose max-w-full dark:prose-invert"><p>The client API handles the API submit protocol. It will handle the request status updates and return the result when the request is completed.</p></div><div class="not-prose h-auto max-h-full w-full space-y-2"><div class="group relative rounded bg-surface-alpha w-full font-mono text-sm h-full max-h-full"><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 p-2 opacity-50 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded border font-heading font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-[1.5] border-transparent bg-transparent text-content-base hover:bg-surface-alpha-strong hover:text-content-strong data-[state=open]:bg-surface-alpha-strong h-9 w-9 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current opacity-70 hover:opacity-100" type="button" aria-label="Copy" name="copyCode"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-files"><path d="M20 7h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2"></path><path d="M9 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"></path><path d="M3 7.6v12.8A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4.6 22h9.8"></path></svg></button></div><pre text="import { fal } from &quot;@fal-ai/client&quot;;

const result = await fal.subscribe(&quot;fal-ai/flux-pro/kontext&quot;, {
  input: {
    prompt: &quot;Put a donut next to the flour.&quot;,
    image_url: &quot;https://v3.fal.media/files/rabbit/rmgBxhwGYb2d3pl3x9sKf_output.png&quot;
  },
  logs: true,
  onQueueUpdate: (update) =&gt; {
    if (update.status === &quot;IN_PROGRESS&quot;) {
      update.logs.map((log) =&gt; log.message).forEach(console.log);
    }
  },
});
console.log(result.data);
console.log(result.requestId);" style="background:transparent;color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%);text-shadow:0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;, &quot;Fira Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, monospace;direction:ltr;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1rem;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-hyphens:none;-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;hyphens:none;padding:1rem;margin:0 auto;overflow:scroll;border-radius:0.3em;overflow-wrap:break-word;max-height:100%"><code class="bg-transparent leading-normal whitespace-pre-wrap" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="background-color:transparent"><span class="token module" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">import</span><span> </span><span class="token imports" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span class="token imports"> fal </span><span class="token imports" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span> </span><span class="token module" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">from</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;@fal-ai/client&quot;</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent">
</span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span></span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">const</span><span> result </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">=</span><span> </span><span class="token control-flow" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">await</span><span> fal</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token method property-access" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">subscribe</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;fal-ai/flux-pro/kontext&quot;</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">,</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>  </span><span class="token literal-property" style="color:hsl(355, 65%, 65%)">input</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">:</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>    </span><span class="token literal-property" style="color:hsl(355, 65%, 65%)">prompt</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">:</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;Put a donut next to the flour.&quot;</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">,</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>    </span><span class="token literal-property" style="color:hsl(355, 65%, 65%)">image_url</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">:</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;https://v3.fal.media/files/rabbit/rmgBxhwGYb2d3pl3x9sKf_output.png&quot;</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>  </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">,</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>  </span><span class="token literal-property" style="color:hsl(355, 65%, 65%)">logs</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">:</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(29, 54%, 61%)">true</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">,</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>  </span><span class="token function-variable" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">onQueueUpdate</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">:</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span class="token parameter">update</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span> </span><span class="token arrow" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">=&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>    </span><span class="token control-flow" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">if</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span>update</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">status</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">===</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;IN_PROGRESS&quot;</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>      update</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">logs</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token method property-access" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">map</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span class="token parameter">log</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span> </span><span class="token arrow" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">=&gt;</span><span> log</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">message</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token method property-access" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">forEach</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span class="token console" style="color:hsl(29, 54%, 61%)">console</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">log</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>    </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span>  </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">,</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span></span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span></span><span class="token console" style="color:hsl(29, 54%, 61%)">console</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token method property-access" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">log</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span>result</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">data</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span><span>
</span></span><span style="background-color:transparent"><span></span><span class="token console" style="color:hsl(29, 54%, 61%)">console</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token method property-access" style="color:hsl(207, 82%, 66%)">log</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">(</span><span>result</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">.</span><span class="token property-access">requestId</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">)</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 bg-stroke-light h-[1px] min-w-full"></div><h2 id="auth" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-xl"><span>2. Authentication</span><a href="#auth" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h2><div class="prose max-w-full dark:prose-invert"><p>The API uses an API Key for authentication. It is recommended you set the <code>FAL_KEY</code> environment variable in your runtime when possible.</p></div><h3 id="auth-api-key" class="flex flex-row space-x-2 pt-2 font-heading font-medium text-content-strong text-lg"><span>API Key</span><a href="#auth-api-key" class="font-mono font-extralight text-content-muted transition-colors hover:text-content-lighter">#</a></h3><div class="space-y-8">In case your app is running in an environment where you cannot set environment variables, you can set the API Key manually as a client configuration.</div><div class="space-y-8"><div class="not-prose h-auto max-h-full w-full space-y-2"><div class="group relative rounded bg-surface-alpha w-full font-mono text-sm h-full max-h-full"><div class="absolute right-0 top-0 p-2 opacity-50 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded border font-heading font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 focus-ring gap-1.5 [&amp;&gt;svg]:stroke-[1.5] border-transparent bg-transparent text-content-base hover:bg-surface-alpha-strong hover:text-content-strong data-[state=open]:bg-surface-alpha-strong h-9 w-9 [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-current opacity-70 hover:opacity-100" type="button" aria-label="Copy" name="copyCode"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-files"><path d="M20 7h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2"></path><path d="M9 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"></path><path d="M3 7.6v12.8A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4.6 22h9.8"></path></svg></button></div><pre text="import { fal } from &quot;@fal-ai/client&quot;;

fal.config({
  credentials: &quot;YOUR_FAL_KEY&quot;
});" style="background:transparent;color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%);text-shadow:0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);font-family:&quot;Fira Code&quot;, &quot;Fira Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;, monospace;direction:ltr;text-align:left;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:normal;word-break:normal;line-height:1rem;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;-webkit-hyphens:none;-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;hyphens:none;padding:1rem;margin:0 auto;overflow:scroll;border-radius:0.3em;overflow-wrap:break-word;max-height:100%"><code class="bg-transparent leading-normal whitespace-pre-wrap" style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="background-color:transparent"><span class="token module" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">import</span><span> </span><span class="token imports" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">{</span><span class="token imports"> fal </span><span class="token imports" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">}</span><span> </span><span class="token module" style="color:hsl(286, 60%, 67%)">from</span><span> </span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(95, 38%, 62%)">&quot;@fal-ai/client&quot;</span><span class="token" style="color:hsl(220, 14%, 71%)">;</span><span>
